        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          In addition to ready-made templates, I provide tailored design and development services to help your business stand out.
          From landing pages to complete websites, every project is built to convert visitors, load quickly, and look polished on every screen size.
        </p>

        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 mb-8">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Strategic Layouts</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Clear page structure designed to guide users toward enquiry and sales.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Performance Focused</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Lightweight pages with optimised assets for a smooth browsing experience.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">SEO Friendly Build</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Semantic structure and clean markup to improve search visibility.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Ongoing Support</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Updates, refinements, and improvements after launch when needed.</p>
